Queue worker time slot exhaused.','Processing queue.'=>'Processing queue.','Page Cache Queue'=>'Page Cache Queue','Prevents page/post updates from clearing corresponding cache entries and instead add them to a queue that can be manually cleared or scheduled to clear via cron.'=>'Prevents page/post updates from clearing corresponding cache entries and instead add them to a queue that can be manually cleared or scheduled to clear via cron.','Always cached.'=>'Always cached.','Regenerate Current Page'=>'Regenerate Current Page','URLs defined here will be excluded from the Always Cached process and will behave normally in that updates will invalidate relevent cache entries rather than be added to the queue. Specify one URL per line. These can be absolute or releative, and can include wildcards.'=>'URLs defined here will be excluded from the Always Cached process and will behave normally in that updates will invalidate relevent cache entries rather than be added to the queue. Specify one URL per line. These can be absolute or releative, and can include wildcards.','Exclusions:'=>'Exclusions:','This button removes all items in the queue. The pending changes for each removed item will not be published until the corresponding existing cache entry expires. Removed items can be re-added to the queue via further modifications to the item or a flush all caches operation with the "Queue Purge All Requests" option enabled.'=>'This button removes all items in the queue. The pending changes for each removed item will not be published until the corresponding existing cache entry expires. Removed items can be re-added to the queue via further modifications to the item or a flush all caches operation with the "Queue Purge All Requests" option enabled.','Clear Queue'=>'Clear Queue','This button will manually trigger the queue processor to begin regenerating the cache entry for each item in the queue, thereby publishing all pending changes.'=>'This button will manually trigger the queue processor to begin regenerating the cache entry for each item in the queue, thereby publishing all pending changes.','Regenerate All'=>'Regenerate All','%1$s%2$s ago%3$s'=>'%1$s%2$s ago%3$s','n/a'=>'n/a','Last processed:'=>'Last processed:','Postponed in queue:'=>'Postponed in queue:','View'=>'View','Pending in queue:'=>'Pending in queue:','When viewing the queue, each entry will have a circular arrow icon that can be clicked to manually regenerate the corresponding cache entry. Once this completes, the queue entry will be removed from the queue.'=>'When viewing the queue, each entry will have a circular arrow icon that can be clicked to manually regenerate the corresponding cache entry. Once this completes, the queue entry will be removed from the queue.','The "Last processed" represents the last time the queue processor was executed.'=>'The "Last processed" represents the last time the queue processor was executed.','The "Postponed in queue" represent pages/posts that failed to process either due to an error or due to the queue processor exceeding its allocated time slot. These entries will be processed on the next scheduled queue processor execution.'=>'The "Postponed in queue" represent pages/posts that failed to process either due to an error or due to the queue processor exceeding its allocated time slot. These entries will be processed on the next scheduled queue processor execution.','The "Pending in queue" represent pages/posts that have been updated but are still serving the pre-update cache entry.'=>'The "Pending in queue" represent pages/posts that have been updated but are still serving the pre-update cache entry.','Queue'=>'Queue','This setting controls the number of latest pages that will be added to the queue when a flush all operation occurs. If this field is left blank it will default to the latest 15 pages.'=>'This setting controls the number of latest pages that will be added to the queue when a flush all operation occurs. If this field is left 